1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,075
Welcome to this special meeting.

2
00:00:02,340 --> 00:00:06,715
You have all been invited here by the design committee for a very important reason.

3
00:00:07,470 --> 00:00:12,095
I am sure that you are aware that a first prototype model has been completed.

4
00:00:12,815 --> 00:00:19,055
The purpose of this meeting is to obtain your reactions to the look of the prototype in an informal way.

5
00:00:19,895 --> 00:00:25,455
You will be asked to note your reactions down quickly, fold your paper, and place it in an envelope.

6
00:00:25,975 --> 00:00:27,455
Please do not write your names.

7
00:00:27,675 --> 00:00:29,175
We want honest and frank comments.

8
00:00:30,035 --> 00:00:36,825
So let's take a few minutes to finish our coffee, then we'll move into the studio for the unveiling of Prototype A.
